	(text "Optional AUX output removed (R59/R60/Q41/F41/D42/J47).\nGPIO3 is now SERVICE_KEY, never an output.\nField inputs remain active LOW (contact closed to GND).\nR62 limits GPIO43 ROM UART contention; validate startup."
